steps.explanation:
Each side is its own divider across $V_s$ (nothing connects a to b).
$v_a = V_s\frac{R_2}{R_1+R_2}$ = {{Vs*R2/(R1+R2)|V}}
$v_b = V_s\frac{R_4}{R_3+R_4}$ = {{Vs*R4/(R3+R4)|V}}
$v_{ab} = v_a - v_b$ = {{v_a-v_b|V}}. This is the bridge circuit used in sensors: $v_{ab} = 0$ when $R_1/R_2 = R_3/R_4$.
